<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ulf_Merbold> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ulf Dietrich Merbold (born June 20, 1941) is a German physicist and astronaut who flew to space three times, becoming the first West-German citizen in space and the first non-American to fly on a NASA spacecraft. Merbold flew on two Space Shuttle missions and on a Russian mission to the space station Mir, spending a total of 49 days in space."@en .
