<http://dbpedia.org/resource/NASA_Astronaut_Group_13> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "NASA Astronaut Group 13 (the Hairballs) was a group of 23 astronauts announced by NASA on 17 January 1990. The group name came from its selection of a black cat as a mascot, to play against the traditional unlucky connotations of the number 13."@en .
