<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Aleksandr_Viktorenko> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Aleksandr Stepanovich Viktorenko** (Template:Lang-ru; born 29 March 1947) is a Soviet/Russian cosmonaut.He was selected as a cosmonaut on March 23, 1978, and retired on May 30, 1997. During his active career he had been Commander of [Soyuz TM-3](:Soyuz_TM-3), [Soyuz TM-8](:Soyuz_TM-8), [Soyuz TM-14](:Soyuz_TM-14) and [Soyuz TM-20](:Soyuz_TM-20). He has spent a total of 489 days in space."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
