<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Scott_Altman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Scott Douglas \"Scooter\" Altman (born August 15, 1959) is a retired United States Navy Captain and naval aviator, engineer, test pilot and former NASA astronaut. He is a veteran of four Space Shuttle missions. His fourth mission on STS-125 was the last servicing mission to the Hubble Space Telescope. He was also the president at ASRC federal, space group."@en .
