<http://dbpedia.org/resource/David_Saint-Jacques> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**David Saint-Jacques** [OQ](:National_Order_of_Quebec) [FRCGS](:Royal_Canadian_Geographical_Society) ([in Quebec](:Quebec_French_phonology): Template:IPA-fr, Template:IPA-fr; born January 6, 1970) is a Canadian [astronaut](:Astronaut) with the [Canadian Space Agency](:Canadian_Space_Agency) (CSA). He is also an [astrophysicist](:Astrophysicist), [engineer](:Engineer), and a [physician](:Physician).In December 2018, he launched to the [International Space Station](:International_Space_Station), as Flight Engineer on Expeditions [57](:Expedition_57), [58](:Expedition_58) and [59](:Expedition_59); he returned to Earth on June 25, 2019."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
