<http://dbpedia.org/resource/University_of_Colorado> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[39°44′43″N 104°59′00″W﻿ / ﻿39.745196°N 104.983340°W﻿ / 39.745196; -104.983340](https://geohack.toolforge.org/geohack.php?pagename=University_of_Colorado&params=39.745196_N_104.98334_W_)The **University of Colorado** (**CU**) is a system of public [universities](:Universities) in [Colorado](:Colorado) consisting of four campuses: [Boulder](:Boulder%2C_Colorado), [Denver](:Denver), [Colorado Springs](:Colorado_Springs), and the Anschutz Medical Campus in [Aurora](:Aurora%2C_Colorado). It is governed by the elected, nine-member Board of [Regents of the University of Colorado](:Regents_of_the_University_of_Colorado)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
