<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bertalan_Farkas> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Bertalan Farkas** (born August 2, 1949) is the first Hungarian [cosmonaut](:Astronaut%23Cosmonaut), [space explorer](:Space_exploration) and [fighter pilot](:Fighter_pilot). [Hungary](:Hungary) became [the seventh nation to be represented in space](:Timeline_of_space_travel_by_nationality) by him. Farkas is also the first [Esperantist](:Esperanto) cosmonaut. He is currently the president of Airlines Service and Trade.Following his mission, Hungarian-American Károly Simonyi ([Charles Simonyi](:Charles_Simonyi%29) was the second Hungarian astronaut – the only person in the entire world who has been twice in space as a [space tourist](:Space_tourism) and who had paid for himself for the [spaceflights](:Spaceflight). The next Hungarian astronaut will travel to the [International Space Station](:International_Space_Station) by 2025."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
