<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Timothy_Creamer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Timothy \"TJ\" Creamer** (born November 15, 1959) is a [NASA](:NASA) flight director, retired [astronaut](:Astronaut) and a [colonel](:Colonel_%28United_States%29) in the [United States Army](:United_States_Army). Creamer was born in [Fort Huachuca](:Fort_Huachuca), [Arizona](:Arizona), but considers [Upper Marlboro, Maryland](:Upper_Marlboro%2C_Maryland), to be his hometown. He is married to the former Margaret E. Hammer. They have two children."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
