<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Steven_Smith_(astronaut)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Steven Lee Smith** (born December 30, 1958), is an American technology executive and former [NASA](:NASA) [astronaut](:Astronaut), being a veteran of four space flights covering 16 million miles and seven spacewalks totaling 49 hours and 25 minutes. Smith’s spacewalk time places him in the top ten on the all-time American and World spacewalk duration lists."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
