<http://dbpedia.org/resource/William_Shepherd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**William McMichael \"Bill\" Shepherd** (born July 26, 1949), ([Capt](:Captain_%28United_States%29), [USN](:United_States_Navy), Ret.), is an American former [Navy SEAL](:Navy_SEAL), [aerospace](:Aerospace_Engineering), [ocean](:Ocean_Engineering), and [mechanical engineer](:Mechanical_Engineering), and [NASA](:NASA) [astronaut](:Astronaut), who served as Commander of [Expedition 1](:Expedition_1), the first crew on the [International Space Station](:International_Space_Station). He is a recipient of the [Congressional Space Medal of Honor](:Congressional_Space_Medal_of_Honor)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
