<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Saratov_Oblast> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Saratov Oblast (Russian: Сара́товская о́бласть, Saratovskaya oblast) is a federal subject of Russia (an oblast), located in the Volga Federal District. Its administrative center is the city of Saratov. As of the 2010 Census, its population was 2,521,892."@en .
