<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Soyuz_MS-07> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Soyuz MS-07 was a Soyuz spaceflight launched on 17 December 2017 at 07:21 UTC. It transported three members of the Expedition 54 crew to the International Space Station. Soyuz MS-07 was the 136th flight of a Soyuz spacecraft. The crew consisted of a Russian commander, Japanese doctor, and an American flight engineer."@en .
