<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Uccle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Uccle (French pronunciation: ​[ykl]) or Ukkel (Dutch: [ˈʏkəl]) is one of the 19 municipalities of the Brussels-Capital Region, Belgium. In common with all of Brussels' municipalities, it is legally bilingual (French–Dutch). It is generally considered an affluent area of the city and is particularly noted for its community of French immigrants."@en .
