<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Stanford_University> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Stanford University, officially Leland Stanford Junior University, is a private research university in Stanford, California. The campus occupies 8,180 acres (3,310 hectares), among the largest in the United States, and enrolls over 17,000 students. Stanford is ranked among the top universities in the world."@en .
