<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Omaha,_Nebraska> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Omaha (/ˈoʊməhɑː/ OH-mə-hah) is the largest city in the U.S. state of Nebraska and the county seat of Douglas County. Omaha is in the Midwestern United States on the Missouri River, about 10 mi (15 km) north of the mouth of the Platte River. The nation's 39th-largest city, Omaha's 2020 census population was 486,051."@en .
