<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Soyuz_MS-21> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Soyuz MS-21 is a Russian Soyuz spaceflight to the International Space Station (ISS) with a crew of three launched from Baikonur on 18 March 2022. The launch was previously planned for 30 March 2022, but in the provisional flight manifest prepared by Roscosmos by the end of Summer 2020, the launch of Soyuz MS-21 was advanced to 18 March 2022. It was the first mission to the ISS with three Roscosmos cosmonauts."@en .
