<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Colorado_State_University> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Colorado State University (Colorado State or CSU) is a public land-grant research university in Fort Collins, Colorado. It is the flagship university of the Colorado State University System. Colorado State University is classified among \"R1: Doctoral Universities – Very high research activity\". The university has been previously known as Colorado Agricultural College from 1870 to 1935 and as the Colorado State College of Agriculture and Mechanic Arts from 1935 to 1957."@en .
