<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Sergey_Volkov_(cosmonaut)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sergey Aleksandrovich Volkov (Russian: Сергей Александрович Волков; born April 1, 1973, in Chuhuiv, Ukrainian SSR, Soviet Union) is a retired Russian cosmonaut and engineer. He was a member of three missions to the International Space Station, spending more than a year in total in space. During his missions he did four spacewalks lasting more than 23 hours in total.Volkov retired from the Cosmonaut group in February 2017."@en .
