<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Sergey_Volkov_(cosmonaut)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Sergey Aleksandrovich Volkov** (Template:Lang-ru; born April 1, 1973, in [Chuhuiv](:Chuhuiv), [Ukrainian SSR](:Ukrainian_SSR), [Soviet Union](:Soviet_Union%29) is a retired Russian cosmonaut and [engineer](:Engineer). He was a member of three missions to the [International Space Station](:International_Space_Station), spending more than a year in total in space. During his missions he did four spacewalks lasting more than 23 hours in total.Volkov retired from the Cosmonaut group in February 2017."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
