<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Jean-Loup_Chrétien> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Jean-Loup Jacques Marie Chrétien** (born 20 August 1938) is a French retired *Général de Brigade* (brigadier general) in the *[Armée de l'Air](:French_Air_and_Space_Force)* (French air force), and a former [CNES](:CNES) [spationaut](:Astronaut). He flew on two Franco-Soviet space missions and a [NASA](:NASA) [Space Shuttle](:Space_Shuttle) mission. Chrétien was the first Frenchman and the first western European in space."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
