<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Naval_Postgraduate_School> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Naval Postgraduate School** (**NPS**) is a public graduate school operated by the [United States Navy](:United_States_Navy) and located in [Monterey, California](:Monterey%2C_California).It offers master’s and doctoral degrees in more than 70 fields of study to the U.S. Armed Forces, DOD civilians and international partners. Established in 1909, the school also offers research fellowship opportunities at the postdoctoral level through the National Academies' [National Research Council](:National_Research_Council_%28United_States%29) research associateship program."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
