<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Franz_Viehböck> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Franz Artur Viehböck** (born 24 August 1960 in [Vienna](:Vienna%29) is an Austrian [electrical engineer](:Electrical_engineering) and [cosmonaut](:Cosmonaut), who became the first Austrian to fly in space. He visited the [Mir](:Mir) space station in 1991 aboard Soyuz TM-13, returning aboard Soyuz TM-12 after spending just over a week in space."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
