<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Yuri_Malenchenko> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Yuri Ivanovich Malenchenko** (Template:Lang-ru; born December 22, 1961) is a retired Russian [cosmonaut](:Cosmonaut). Malenchenko became the first person to marry in space, on 10 August 2003, when he married Ekaterina Dmitrieva, who was in [Texas](:Texas), while he was 240 miles (390 km) over New Zealand, on the [International Space Station](:International_Space_Station). As of June 2016, Malenchenko ranks [second for career time in space](:List_of_spaceflight_records%23Total_time_in_space) due to his time on both [Mir](:Mir) and the [International Space Station](:International_Space_Station) (ISS). He is a former Commander of the [International Space Station](:International_Space_Station)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
