<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Cle_Elum,_Washington> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Cle Elum** ( [*klee*](:Help%3APronunciation_respelling_key) [*ELL-um*](:Help%3APronunciation_respelling_key)) is a city in [Kittitas County](:Kittitas_County%2C_Washington), [Washington](:Washington_%28state%29), United States. The population was 1,872 at the [2010 census](:2010_United_States_Census). About 96 miles (154 km) by car from [Seattle](:Seattle), Cle Elum is a popular area for camping and outdoor activities."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
