<http://dbpedia.org/resource/PLA_Air_Force_Aviation_University> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The PLA Air Force Aviation University (Chinese: 中国人民解放军空军航空大学; pinyin: Zhōngguó Rénmín Jiěfàngjūn Kōngjūn Hángkōng Dàxué) is a military university located in Changchun, Jilin, China. As of fall 2014, the university has 7 campuses, consists of 7 departments, covers a total area of 36,000 mu, with more than 19,000,000 square meters of floor space."@en .
