<http://dbpedia.org/resource/University_of_Texas_Health_Science_Center_at_Houston> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**The University of Texas Health Science Center at Houston** (**UTHealth**) is a [public](:Public_university) [academic health science center](:Academic_health_science_centre) in [Houston, Texas](:Houston%2C_Texas), United States. It was created in 1972 by The University of Texas System Board of Regents. It is located in the [Texas Medical Center](:Texas_Medical_Center), the largest medical center in the world. It is composed of six schools: [McGovern Medical School](:McGovern_Medical_School), [The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center UTHealth Graduate School of Biomedical Sciences](:University_of_Texas_Graduate_School_of_Biomedical_Sciences_at_Houston), [UTHealth School of Dentistry](:UTHealth_School_of_Dentistry), [Cizik School of Nursing](:University_of_Texas_Health_Science_Center_at_Houston_School_of_Nursing), [UTHealth School of Biomedical Informatics](:University_of_Texas_School_of_Biomedical_Informatics) and [UTHealth School of Public Health](:University_of_Texas_School_of_Public_Health)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
