<http://dbpedia.org/resource/University_of_Tennessee> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The University of Tennessee (officially The University of Tennessee, Knoxville; or UT Knoxville; UTK; or UT) is a public land-grant research university in Knoxville, Tennessee. Founded in 1794, two years before Tennessee became the 16th state, it is the flagship campus of the University of Tennessee system, with ten undergraduate colleges and eleven graduate colleges. It hosts more than 30,000 students from all 50 states and more than 100 foreign countries. It is classified among \"R1: Doctoral Universities – Very high research activity\"."@en .
