<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kayla_Barron> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Kayla Jane Barron** (born September 19, 1987) is an American [submarine warfare officer](:Submarine_warfare), [engineer](:Engineer) and [NASA](:NASA) astronaut. Barron was selected in June 2017 as a member of the [NASA Astronaut Group 22](:NASA_Astronaut_Group_22), and later qualified as an astronaut in 2020. Barron took part in her first spaceflight, [SpaceX Crew-3](:SpaceX_Crew-3), as part of the crew of [Expedition 66](:Expedition_66)/[67](:Expedition_67), which launched to the [International Space Station](:International_Space_Station) on November 10, 2021. Before joining NASA, Barron was a submarine warfare officer and Flag Aide to the Superintendent at the Naval Academy."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
