<http://dbpedia.org/resource/STS-55> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "STS-55, or Deutschland 2 (D-2), was the 55th overall flight of the NASA Space Shuttle and the 14th flight of Shuttle Columbia. This flight was a multinational Spacelab flight involving 88 experiments from eleven different nations. The experiments ranged from biology sciences to simple Earth observations."@en .
