<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Franz_Viehböck> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Franz Artur Viehböck (born 24 August 1960 in Vienna) is an Austrian electrical engineer and cosmonaut, who became the first Austrian to fly in space. He visited the Mir space station in 1991 aboard Soyuz TM-13, returning aboard Soyuz TM-12 after spending just over a week in space."@en .
