<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Cornell_College> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Cornell College** is a [private college](:Private_college) in [Mount Vernon, Iowa](:Mount_Vernon%2C_Iowa). Originally the **Iowa Conference Seminary**, the school was founded in 1853 by George Bryant Bowman. Four years later, in 1857, the name was changed to Cornell College, in honor of iron tycoon [William Wesley Cornell](:William_Wesley_Cornell), a distant relative of [Ezra Cornell](:Ezra_Cornell) (founder of [Cornell University](:Cornell_University) in [Ithaca, New York](:Ithaca%2C_New_York%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
