<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Gennady_Sarafanov> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Gennady Vasiliyevich Sarafanov** (Template:Lang-ru; 1 January 1942 – 29 September 2005) was a [Soviet](:Soviet_Union) [cosmonaut](:Astronaut) who flew on the [Soyuz 15](:Soyuz_15) [spaceflight](:Spaceflight) in 1974. This mission was intended to dock with the [space station](:Space_station) [Salyut 3](:Salyut_3), but failed to do so after the docking system malfunctioned.Sarafanov was born in Sinenkiye, [Saratov Oblast](:Saratov_Oblast), [USSR](:Soviet_Union). He graduated from the [Soviet Air Force](:Soviet_Air_Force) academy and held the rank of [Colonel](:Colonel).He made a single spaceflight before resigning from the space programme in 1986 and subsequently lectured on technology. He died in [Moscow](:Moscow), [Russia](:Russia).He was awarded:"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
