<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Expedition_24> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expedition 24 was the 24th long-duration mission to the International Space Station (ISS). Expedition 24 initially had two planned spacewalks, one Russian and one American Extra-vehicular Activity (EVA). The U.S. EVA was re-planned and a second U.S. EVA was added."@en .
