<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Catherine_Coleman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Catherine Grace** \"**Cady**\" **Coleman** (born December 14, 1960) is an American [chemist](:Chemist), an [engineer](:Engineer), a former [United States Air Force](:United_States_Air_Force) colonel, and a retired [NASA](:NASA) [astronaut](:Astronaut). She is a veteran of two [Space Shuttle](:Space_Shuttle) missions, and departed the [International Space Station](:International_Space_Station) on May 23, 2011, as a crew member of [Expedition 27](:Expedition_27) after logging 159 days in space."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
