<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Clayton_Anderson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Clayton Conrad Anderson** (born February 23, 1959) is a retired [NASA](:NASA) [astronaut](:Astronaut). Launched on [STS-117](:STS-117), he replaced [Sunita Williams](:Sunita_Williams) on June 10, 2007 as a member of the ISS [Expedition 15](:Expedition_15) crew. He is currently an author, a motivational speaker, and a [Professor of Practice](:Clinical_professor) at Iowa State University in [Ames, Iowa](:Ames%2C_Iowa). In 2022 he became the president and CEO of the [Strategic Air Command & Aerospace Museum](:Strategic_Air_Command_%26_Aerospace_Museum)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
