<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Thuringia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Thuringia (English: /θəˈrɪndʒiə/; German: Thüringen [ˈtyːʁɪŋən]), officially the Free State of Thuringia (Freistaat Thüringen [ˈfʁaɪʃtaːt ˈtyːʁɪŋən]), is a state of Germany. Located in central Germany, it covers 16,171 square kilometres (6,244 sq mi), being the sixth smallest of the sixteen German States (including City States). It has a population of about 2.1 million."@en .
