<http://dbpedia.org/resource/University_of_Louisiana_at_Lafayette> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The University of Louisiana at Lafayette (UL Lafayette, University of Louisiana, ULL, or UL) is a public research university in Lafayette, Louisiana. It has the largest enrollment within the nine-campus University of Louisiana System and the second largest enrollment in Louisiana, behind only Louisiana State University. It is classified among \"R1: Doctoral Universities – Very high research activity\"."@en .
