<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Oleg_Artemyev> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Oleg Germanovich Artemyev** (Template:Lang-ru; born December 28, 1970) is a [Russian](:Russian_people) [Cosmonaut](:Astronaut) for the [Russian Federal Space Agency](:Russian_Federal_Space_Agency). He was selected as part of the RKKE-15 Cosmonaut group in 2003. He was a flight engineer of [Expedition 39](:Expedition_39) and [40](:Expedition_40) to the [International Space Station](:International_Space_Station), in 2018 he returned to space as the Commander of [Soyuz MS-08](:Soyuz_MS-08), and in 2022 he returned to space as the Commander of [Soyuz MS-21](:Soyuz_MS-21)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
