<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Wang_Yaping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Wang Yaping (Chinese: 王亚平; pinyin: Wáng Yàpíng; born January 1980) is a Chinese military transport pilot and taikonaut. Wang was the second female taikonaut selected to the People's Liberation Army Astronaut Corps, the second Chinese woman in space, and the first Chinese woman to perform a spacewalk. As of April 2022, she set a new record for longest stay in space by a Chinese astronaut with a cumulative 197 days in space."@en .
