<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ramat_Gan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Ramat Gan** (Template:Lang-he or רָמַת־גַּן, Template:IPA-he is a city in the [Tel Aviv District](:Tel_Aviv_District) of Israel, located east of the municipality of [Tel Aviv](:Tel_Aviv) and part of the [Tel Aviv metropolitan area](:Gush_Dan). It is home to one of the world's major [diamond](:Diamond) exchanges, and many [high-tech](:High-tech) industries.Ramat Gan was established in 1921 as a [moshav shitufi](:Moshav_shitufi), a communal farming settlement. In 2022 it had a population of 172,486."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
