<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Zhai_Zhigang> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Zhai Zhigang** ([Chinese](:Chinese_language): 翟志刚; [pinyin](:Pinyin): *Zhái Zhìgāng*; born 11 October 1966) is a Chinese [major general](:Jiang_%28rank%29) of the [People's Liberation Army Strategic Support Force](:People%27s_Liberation_Army_Strategic_Support_Force) (PLASSF) in active service as a [People's Liberation Army Astronaut Corps](:People%27s_Liberation_Army_Astronaut_Corps) (PLAAC) [taikonaut](:Taikonaut). During the [Shenzhou 7](:Shenzhou_7) mission in 2008, he became the first Chinese citizen to carry out a [spacewalk](:Spacewalk). He was a [People's Liberation Army Air Force](:People%27s_Liberation_Army_Air_Force) (PLAAF) [fighter pilot](:Fighter_pilot)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
