<http://dbpedia.org/resource/University_of_Alabama_in_Huntsville> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The University of Alabama in Huntsville (UAH) is a public research university in Huntsville, Alabama. The university is accredited by the Southern Association of Colleges and Schools and comprises nine colleges: arts, humanities & social sciences; business; education; engineering; honors; nursing; professional & continuing studies; science; and graduate. The university's enrollment is approximately 10,000. It is part of the University of Alabama System and is classified among \"R1: Doctoral Universities: Very High Research Activity\"."@en .
