<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Shannon_Walker> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Shannon Walker** (born June 4, 1965) is an American physicist and a [NASA](:NASA) [astronaut](:Astronaut) selected in 2004. She launched on her first mission into space on June 25, 2010, onboard [Soyuz TMA-19](:Soyuz_TMA-19) and spent over 163 days in space.She returned to space for her second long duration mission on November 15, 2020, onboard [SpaceX Crew-1](:SpaceX_Crew-1), the first operational flight of [SpaceX](:SpaceX)'s [Crew Dragon](:Crew_Dragon) spacecraft."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
