<http://dbpedia.org/resource/University_of_Houston–Clear_Lake> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **University of Houston–Clear Lake** (**UHCL**) is a [public university](:Public_university) in [Pasadena](:Pasadena%2C_Texas) and [Houston](:Houston), [Texas](:Texas), with branch campuses in [Pearland](:Pearland%2C_Texas) and [Texas Medical Center](:Texas_Medical_Center). It is part of the [University of Houston System](:University_of_Houston_System). Founded in 1971, UHCL had an enrollment of more than 9,000 students for fall 2019.The university serves students in four academic colleges. UHCL offers 97 degree programs: 46 bachelors, 48 masters, and three doctoral. Awarding more than 2,100 degrees annually, the university's alumni base exceeds 73,000."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
