<http://dbpedia.org/resource/French_Third_Republic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The French Third Republic (French: Troisième République, sometimes written as La IIIe République) was the system of government adopted in France from 4 September 1870, when the Second French Empire collapsed during the Franco-Prussian War, until 10 July 1940, after the Fall of France during World War II led to the formation of the Vichy government."@en .
