<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Eberhard_Köllner> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Eberhard Köllner** (born 29 September 1939 in [Stassfurt](:Stassfurt), Germany) was selected for [Soyuz 31](:Soyuz_31) as the backup for [Sigmund Jähn](:Sigmund_J%C3%A4hn).He later became the Director of the Airforce Academy of the [German Democratic Republic](:German_Democratic_Republic) in the rank of an *[Oberst](:Oberst)* (\"Colonel\"), following the reunion of Germany he refused to be transferred to the (West) German *[Bundeswehr](:Bundeswehr)*. He is currently working in private industries."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
