<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Wang_Yaping> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Wang Yaping** ([Chinese](:Chinese_language): 王亚平; [pinyin](:Pinyin): *Wáng Yàpíng*; born January 1980) is a Chinese [military transport pilot](:Aircraft_pilot%23Military) and [taikonaut](:Taikonaut). Wang was the second [female taikonaut](:List_of_female_astronauts) selected to the [People's Liberation Army Astronaut Corps](:People%27s_Liberation_Army_Astronaut_Corps), the second [Chinese woman in space](:Chinese_women_in_space), and the first Chinese woman to perform a [spacewalk](:Spacewalk).As of April 2022, she set a new record for longest stay in space by a Chinese astronaut with a cumulative 197 days in space."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
