<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Soyuz_TM-8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Soyuz TM-8 was a 1989 spaceflight which carried the fifth long duration crew to the Soviet space station Mir. It was part of the Soyuz-TM series of spacecraft, which were the fourth generation of the Soviet Soyuz. Soyuz TM-8 was the eighth crewed spaceflight to Mir, and spent 166 days in orbit."@en .
