<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Expedition_41> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Expedition 41 was the 41st expedition to the International Space Station. It began on 10 September 2014 with the undocking of Soyuz TMA-12M, returning the crew of Expedition 40 to Earth. The expedition ended with the undocking of Soyuz TMA-13M on November 10, 2014. The remainder of Expedition 41's crew joined Expedition 42."@en .
