<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Chen_Quan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Chen Quan** ([simplified Chinese](:Simplified_Chinese_characters): 陈全; [traditional Chinese](:Traditional_Chinese_characters): 陳全; [pinyin](:Pinyin): *Chén Quán*; born December 1963) is a Chinese pilot selected as part of the [Shenzhou program](:Shenzhou_spacecraft).Chen was born in [Suining](:Suining), [Sichuan](:Sichuan), [China](:China).He joined the [People's Liberation Army Air Force](:People%27s_Liberation_Army_Air_Force) and became a fighter interceptor pilot and later as a [regiment](:Regiment) commander in the PLAAF."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
