<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Vasily_Tsibliyev> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Vasily Vasiliyevich Tsibliyev** (Template:Lang-ru; born on February 20, 1954) is a Russian [cosmonaut](:Cosmonaut).He was selected as a cosmonaut on March 26, 1987. Tsibliyev flew as Commander on [Soyuz TM-17](:Soyuz_TM-17) from July 1, 1993 to January 14, 1994 and on [Soyuz TM-25](:Soyuz_TM-25) from February 2, 1997 to August 14 of the same year. He retired on June 19, 1998. Tsibliyev is currently Chief of the [Yuri Gagarin Cosmonauts Training Center](:Yuri_Gagarin_Cosmonauts_Training_Center) at Star City, Russia.Tsibliyev is married with two children.Tsibliyev was the commander in charge of *[Mir](:Mir)* when it was hit by a *[Progress](:Progress_%28spacecraft%29)* spacecraft in 1997."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
