<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Scott_Altman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Scott Douglas \"Scooter\" Altman** (born August 15, 1959) is a retired [United States Navy](:United_States_Navy) [Captain](:Captain_%28U%2ES%2E_Navy%29) and [naval aviator](:Naval_aviator), [engineer](:Engineer), [test pilot](:Test_pilot) and former [NASA](:NASA) [astronaut](:Astronaut). He is a veteran of four [Space Shuttle](:Space_Shuttle) missions. His fourth mission on [STS-125](:STS-125) was the last servicing mission to the [Hubble Space Telescope](:Hubble_Space_Telescope). As of November 2022, he is the president of the Space operating group for ASRC Federal."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
