<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Chuhuiv> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Chuhuiv (Ukrainian: Чугуїв) or Chuguev (Russian: Чугуев) is a Ukrainian city in Kharkiv Oblast. The city is the administrative center of Chuhuiv Raion (district). It hosts the administration of , one of the hromadas of Ukraine. Chuhuiv's food industry focuses on producing mayonnaise along with other staple supporting condiments."@en .
