<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Saratovsky_District> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Saratovsky District (Russian: Сара́товский райо́н) is an administrative and municipal district (raion), one of the thirty-eight in Saratov Oblast, Russia. It is located in the center of the oblast. The area of the district is 1,900 square kilometers (730 sq mi). Its administrative center is the city of Saratov (which is not administratively a part of the district). Population: 48,105 (2010 Census); 46,233 (2002 Census); 45,252 (1989 Census)."@en .
